{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S03、S06、S11等短停留段的信息密度偏高，连续阅读时不如X轻松，X的左右分栏也更便于快速扫视。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y虽然更费一些阅读注意力，但【】突出每段真正重要的心理落点，感受文字又通过到时出现与音乐进程对应，让观众不只是知道他难过，还能感受到他为什么难过、情绪怎样转变。尤其从舍不得旧日亲近、怀疑离开是否正确，到重新承认想念却不愿回去忍受委屈，Y的心理因果和前后照应更完整，音乐感受也更具体，有力度、节奏、音色和情绪层次，不只是笼统贴上悲伤或温暖的标签。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "655ffa33-a698-4027-9d2d-0be9be2d76d7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T040932682361Z", "elapsed_seconds": 22.469, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T04:09:55.161874+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "053cd44f3ff4c7d3f7cceb732eb329d374724dd503dbe17e81bf5adf489c93e8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_at